54.
Employment of young persons on dangerous machines.
- The following machines shall be deemed to be of such dangerous character that young persons shall not work at them
unless the provisions of Section 23 (1) are complied with :
Power presses other than hydraulic presses;
Milling machines used in the metal trades;
Guillotine machines
Circular saws;
Platen printing machines.
